Benediktus IV punika putra saking Mammalus, pendunung asli &lt;a href="Roma"&gt;Roma&lt;/a&gt;. Sejarawan &lt;a href="abad%20kaping%2010"&gt;abad kaping 10&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Frodoard"&gt;Frodoard&lt;/a&gt;, ingkang maringi jejuluk Benediktus ingkang Agung, ngalembana wiyosanipun ingkang mulya lan kamirahanipun tumrap masarakat umum.
Benediktus IV ngiyataken pentahbisan ingkang dipunlampahi déning &lt;a href="Paus%20Formosus"&gt;Paus Formosus&lt;/a&gt;, ingkang jenazahipun dipunkedhuk malih déning &lt;a href="Paus%20Stefanus%20VI"&gt;Paus Stefanus VI&lt;/a&gt; lan ngadili piyambakipun ing &lt;a href="Konsli%20Cadaver"&gt;Konsli Cadaver&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="897"&gt;897&lt;/a&gt;. Ing taun &lt;a href="901"&gt;901&lt;/a&gt;, sasampunipun Kaisar-Kaisar &lt;a href="Carolingian"&gt;Carolingian&lt;/a&gt; sampun boten wonten, Benediktus tumut dhumateng conto &lt;a href="Paus%20Leo%20III"&gt;Paus Leo III&lt;/a&gt; lan paring makutha dhumateng &lt;a href="Louis%20saking%20Provence"&gt;Louis saking Provence&lt;/a&gt; dados &lt;a href="Kaisar%20Romawi%20Suci"&gt;Kaisar Romawi Suci&lt;/a&gt;. Ing mangsa kepausanipun, piyambakipun ugi ngekskomunikasi &lt;a href="Baldwin%20II%20saking%20Flanders"&gt;Baldwin II saking Flanders&lt;/a&gt; amargi mrajaya &lt;a href="Fulk%20saking%20Rheims"&gt;Fulk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Biskop%20Agung%20Rheims"&gt;Biskop Agung Rheims&lt;/a&gt;.
