<li>&lt;a href="1883"&gt;1883&lt;/a&gt;-Ing tanggal &lt;a href="26%20Agustus"&gt;26 Agustus&lt;/a&gt;, njeblugé gunung &lt;a href="Krakatau"&gt;Krakatau&lt;/a&gt; lan tsunami niwasaké punjul 36.000 jiwa.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;-Ing tanggal &lt;a href="26%20Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;26 Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; 2004, &lt;a href="Lindhu%20Samodra%20Hindhia%202004"&gt;Lindhu Samodra Hindhia 2004&lt;/a&gt; kanthi lésus tsunami ngasilaké kurban jiwa punjul 200.000 ing &lt;a href="Ac%C3%A8h"&gt;Acèh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sumatra%20Lor"&gt;Sumatra Lor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Asia%20Kidul-W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Asia Kidul-Wétan&lt;/a&gt; liyané, &lt;a href="Asia%20Kidul"&gt;Asia Kidul&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Afrika"&gt;Afrika&lt;/a&gt;. Ayo delengen ing artikel: &lt;a href="Lindhu%20Samodra%20Hindia%202004"&gt;Lindhu Samodra Hindia 2004&lt;/a&gt; kanggo katrangan luwih pepak.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;-Ing tanggal &lt;a href="17%20Juli"&gt;17 Juli&lt;/a&gt; 2006, tsunami ngasilaké kurban jiwa punjul 500 ing &lt;a href="pasisir%20kidul"&gt;pasisir kidul&lt;/a&gt; sisih wétan &lt;a href="Jawa%20Barat"&gt;Jawa Barat&lt;/a&gt; lan sisih &lt;a href="kulon"&gt;kulon&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Jawa%20Tengah"&gt;Jawa Tengah&lt;/a&gt;. Mangga pirsani ing artikel: &lt;a href="Lindhu%20lan%20Tsunami%20Pangandaran%202006"&gt;Lindhu lan Tsunami Pangandaran 2006&lt;/a&gt; kanggo katrangan luwih pepak.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="12%20September"&gt;12 September&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bengkulu%2C%20M%208.4"&gt;Bengkulu, M 8.4&lt;/a&gt;, Niwasake 3 jiwa. Dhuwure tsunami 3–4 m.</li>
