<doc id="3591" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3591" title="Hessen">
Hessen

Hessen wujud salah siji &lt;a href="Prat%C3%A9lan%20Praja%20Jerman"&gt;praja&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Federal%20Jerman"&gt;Républik Federal Jerman&lt;/a&gt;. Kutha krajané ana ing &lt;a href="Wiesbaden"&gt;Wiesbaden&lt;/a&gt;. Wiyar wewengkoné 21.114,72&amp;nbsp;km² kanthi sing ndunungi 6.045.000 (Dhésèmber 2013). Saiki dipanggedhèni déning &lt;a href="Volker%20Bouffier"&gt;Volker Bouffier&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="CDU"&gt;CDU&lt;/a&gt; (wiwit 31 Agustus 2010).
